WEBVTT

00:55:59.449 --> 00:56:01.770
that we think will give us
ultimate satisfaction,

00:56:01.794 --> 00:56:04.214
and sometimes it's alcohol,
sometimes it's opioids,

00:56:04.238 --> 00:56:05.450
sometimes it's Twitter.

00:56:05.474 --> 00:56:08.753
And the thing about idolatry,
at the beginning, it feels great.

00:56:08.777 --> 00:56:11.049
It asks for nothing
and gives you everything.

00:56:11.073 --> 00:56:14.109
The first drink
of the martini tastes great.

00:56:14.133 --> 00:56:15.461
At the end of idolatry,

00:56:15.485 --> 00:56:17.601
it gives you nothing
and asks for everything.

00:56:17.625 --> 00:56:19.570
Alcoholism totally takes over your life.

00:56:19.594 --> 00:56:21.632
And I think that's true of the smartphone.

00:56:21.656 --> 00:56:25.533
And we've got this new technology that,
at the beginning, we thought,

00:56:25.557 --> 00:56:27.547
"Oh, it's going to make everything great.

00:56:27.571 --> 00:56:30.118
We'll all communicate
and the world will be peaceful."